-14T18:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/nord-stream-trial-opens-in-germany-defense-seeks-dismissal/a-79662942--840b7e9fd757.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/nord-stream-trial-opens-in-germany-defense-seeks-dismissal/a-79662942?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Serhii Kuznietsov is accused of attacking civilian infrastructure in the 2022 sabotage of the Russian gas pipeline to Germany. His lawyers called Nord Stream a military target, and said their client is sworn to secrecy.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>How Trump's diesel deal with Russia will impact the United States and Ukraine</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1e99c815c8d5b3aee64d326982e06df3c00e6db55083e38aa34ccc5361a00261</id><updated>2026-10-15T04:53:22Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T17:55:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/how-trump-s-diesel-deal-with-russia-will-impact-the-united-states-and-ukraine/a-79658596--f95bfc6ecbf1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/how-trump-s-diesel-deal-with-russia-will-impact-the-united-states-and-ukraine/a-79658596?maca=en-rss-en-top-1022-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">US President Trump's diesel deal with Russia has alarmed Ukraine and its allies. What is he hoping to achieve at home, and what does the deal mean for Kyiv and Moscow?</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Japanese journalist arrest in Russia's Far East draws rebuke from Tokyo in latest diplomatic spat with Moscow</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:86a7583f4d8e966a6829a0f56defb226a5671b6af413da9ab164753bca58fd21</id><updated>2026-10-15T04:53:22Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T17:28:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/japanese-journalist-arrest-in-russia-s-far-east-draws-rebuke-from-tokyo-in-latest-diplomatic-spat-wi/a-79663428--29b99abb7ad1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel=